From d78b112513027133c5ddde895b3b3e7e3b77cd4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OnePlus 11 mainline port <noreply@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 23:35:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] arm64: add OnePlus 11 Linux port checkpoint through
 salami058

Add the board description, peripheral integration, GPU, USB role and charging
support, Bluetooth, touchscreen input, and native display bring-up drivers.

Wi-Fi, slot-1 LTE IPv4, USB Ethernet, basic 80% charging limits, Adreno rendering,
and real touchscreen/Bluetooth mouse input have device evidence. Native DSI
display remains black through salami058; the bootloader display is visible.
Keep this unresolved display state explicit rather than treating a framebuffer
capture or software page flip as physical panel acceptance.
