Subject: [PATCH 03/10] power: supply: qcom_battmgr: compute OnePlus 11 battery
 power

The OnePlus 11 (SM8550) battery firmware answers BATT_POWER_NOW with the
same constant (-17665209) whatever the load, so userspace saw -17 W at
all times. Take the voltage times current path the Kaanapali Oplus
firmware already uses, for POWER_NOW only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr.c | 8 ++++++--
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

